Subject: [PATCH 11/25] Fix AttributeError 'str' object has no attribute
 'items' in RAG pipeline and prompt builder

- src/llm/prompt_builder.py: Normalize metadata JSON strings to dicts before access; handle string history entries safely; apply OCR case normalization in summary prompts
- src/llm/rag_pipeline.py: Add _to_dicts helper for robust sequence normalization; ensure graph expansion, hybrid search, and chunk merging handle serialized metadata correctly
- src/processing/text_cleaner.py: (Implied dependency) Ensure normalize_metadata utility is available and correctly imported by LLM modules

Resolves runtime crashes during context processing caused by type mismatches between stored JSON strings and expected dictionary objects.
